  "rows": {
    "900.6.10(253)": {
      "explanation": "Exception RM 253 limits residential buildings to detached and semi-detached houses, duplexes, triplexes and street-fronting townhouses, sets minimum lot frontages by building type (8.0 m, 12.0 m, 5.0 m), a maximum height of 11.0 m and 3 storeys, a maximum FSI of 1.0, a 6.0 m minimum rear yard and side yard minimums of 0.5 m to 1.2 m; duplexes and triplexes may attach to one neighbour of the same type. On 464, 466 and 468 Winona Drive, By-law 712-2014 prevails.",
